ll funnel up the Alberni Inlet this evening. Wind gusts will peak near 70 km/h late this evening and near midnight before easing overnight.\n\nLocal utility outages are possible.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to BCstorm@ec.gc.ca or post reports on social media using #BCStorm.","alert_text_fr":"Vents forts attendus.\n\nQuand : ce soir et cette nuit.\n\nO\u00f9 : l'\u00eele de Vancouver - Int\u00e9rieur, pr\u00e8s de Port Alberni.\n\nRemarques : une autre temp\u00eate d'une s\u00e9rie de puissants syst\u00e8mes m\u00e9t\u00e9orologiques arrivera ce soir ou cette nuit. Des vents du sud s'engouffreront dans l'inlet Alberni ce soir. Les rafales atteindront un maximum de pr\u00e8s de 70 km/h tard ce soir et vers minuit avant de faiblir au cours de la nuit.\n\nDes pannes d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 pourraient survenir par endroits.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoBC@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #BCMeteo.","risk_colour_en":null,"risk_colour_fr":null,"confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"Inland Vancouver Island","feature_name_fr":"\u00eele de Vancouver - Int\u00e9rieur","province":"BC","status_en":"issued","status_fr":"\u00e9mis","feature_id":"fea1-2318"}},{"id":"1739131421890631082202611250503_fea1-1168","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-80.18780328,43.016856],[-80.07324941,42.9762513],[-80.00147051,43.09386078],[-79.9792218,43.13023784],[-79.98446331,43.1321451],[-79.98601211,43.13270584],[-79.98613418,43.13275161],[-79.9899337,43.13413247],[-79.99241331,43.13496404],[-79.99982162,43.13769523],[-80.00309471,43.13890464],[-80.00356012,43.13905343],[-80.00454434,43.13937391],[-80.00774113,43.14054138],[-80.00962564,43.